          "message": {
            "text": "The MathML cell is a separate authenticated contract so adding FreeSans cannot silently change the ratified 348-cell corpus or reuse its envelopes. The package, extracted face, four math-auto scalars, source glyphs, and hinted/unhinted subset bytes all participate in the canonical supplemental cell identity.",
            "markdown": "The MathML cell is a separate authenticated contract so adding FreeSans cannot silently change the ratified 348-cell corpus or reuse its envelopes. The package, extracted face, four math-auto scalars, source glyphs, and hinted/unhinted subset bytes all participate in the canonical supplemental cell identity."
          },
